> data\processed\docs\case-law\commonlii\LKSC\1995\10.md:1:# Fernando and Others v. Land Reform Commission and Another 
- SLR - 122, Vol 2 of 1997 [1995] LKSC 10; (1997) 2 Sri LR 122 (15 June 1995)
