Copies of documents placed before Bench of Three (3) Judges and copies of the petition and affidavit of the present 
1st Respondent Petitioner to be made available to the judges of the Fuller Bench. TDB 22/12/95 In response to the 
directions of the Acting Chief Justice, the Registrar of the Supreme Court on the 29th of February 1996, notified the 
